      "id": "claim_a8cbb9872cb6499ca215c2e4d87e290d",
      "statement": "build_features is a pure, stateless transform that replaces the DAYS_EMPLOYED sentinel 365243 with NaN, derives AGE_YEARS and four financial ratios, converts infinities to NaN, and returns exactly MODEL_FEATURES; CODE_GENDER, SK_ID_CURR and TARGET are excluded from the model features (gender is retained only for bias analysis).",
